R128 PM-direct commit 修了 pnpm PATH 问题, 但 pnpm dist:mac 报新错:
- app-builder-lib@26.15.3 用 @electron/get 的 ElectronDownloadCacheMode.ReadWrite
- 但 @electron/get@3.0.0 不导出这个 enum (只有 Cache class)
- electronGet.ts:131 resolveCacheMode() 读 undefined.ReadWrite 报错

R129 修 ELECTRON_MIRROR 注入 (与 install.sh 一致):
- wenshu_cli/subcommands/update.py _run_update_build_step 加 ELECTRON_MIRROR
- 默认 https://npmmirror.com/mirrors/electron/ (国内镜像)
- 装 user 跑 wenshu update 时 electron-builder 自动走国内镜像

不修 resolveCacheMode bug (electron-builder 26.15.3 内部):
- @electron/get@3.0.0 不导出 ElectronDownloadCacheMode enum
- 装 user 网络不通 GitHub, dmgbuild tarball 拉不到
- 装 user 拍板: PM-direct 跑 build + 拷 DMG

